5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be with you all. To ensure our future growth is sustainable and transparent, I would like to examine the independent checks on holdings' reported figures and the appraisal needs at the last audit.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that transparency is key. To understand the actual stability of our portfolio, I will look into account retention through price rises and the profile of the exits and the write-off.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I believe we must be mindful of our long-term liquidity. I will look into the reserve accounts and follow-on calls, as well as the terms of last winter's credit line.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm so excited to get started! I want to see how we're doing with talent, so I'll check the retained recruiters' placement times and the adviser bench and partner board seats!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the security review time before first deployment and the delivery records of two holdings. I believe it is important to understand the actual timeline from investment to operation.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Servas,,It seems we have a comprehensive plan. By looking at different angles—from liquidity to talent—we will gain a holistic view. I am curious to see how these details will illuminate our path forward.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"Indeed. However, we must ensure that the data we gather reflects reality, not just the narratives we've constructed. I hope the retention figures provide a clear picture of actual customer loyalty.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I agree. Data is only useful if it is objective. I expect the credit line terms to reveal whether our current financial flexibility is sufficient for the upcoming seed investment and beyond.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I totally agree! I just hope the recruiters are actually finding people quickly. It'll be so much better if we can just focus on the fun part of picking the company!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,The narratives are often misleading. I am interested in the gap between the plan and the reality of deployment. That is where the true risks usually hide.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,"Wisdom often lies in the gaps between our expectations and the truth. Let us remain open-minded as we receive our findings, for the most unexpected data often provides the most profound guidance.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"I believe so. If we rely on curated success stories, we risk repeating the same mistakes. I intend to cross-reference the exit profiles with the retention data to see if our wins were truly sustainable.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minako,,"Sustainability is the priority. If our capital is depleting faster than anticipated, we cannot afford a mistake. I will be analyzing my findings specifically to see how much breathing room we actually have.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm with you, Minako! We need to make sure we're not just guessing. I'll be looking at my results to see if we have the right people ready to help our next big win!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"I will focus on the patterns of delay. If the delivery records show a consistent lag, it suggests a systemic issue that no amount of talent or liquidity can easily fix.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Servas,,Your perspectives are all invaluable. Let us proceed with a spirit of cooperation and honesty. I look forward to seeing how these diverse pieces of the puzzle fit together to guide our final decision.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I am ready to proceed. Let us hope the findings are candid and devoid of embellishment. I look forward to analyzing the results and discussing the candidates with you all in the next round.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
